    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juggler</strong> is a challenging arcade game that's all about precise timing and splitting your focus. Conquer  numerous challenges, unlock new balls with unique characteristics, augment your skills with powers, and work your way to juggling the most difficult thing in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like just vibing and getting locked into mesmerizing juggling flow? Play in infinite time mode and juggle as long as you like! No need to worry about winning or losing.</p>",
